.TH TINYDNS 1 "2026-07-23" "rgbdns 0.1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tinydns \- authoritative DNS server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tinydns
.SH DESCRIPTION
Loads a compiled tinydns zone database and serves authoritative DNS over UDP
and TCP.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DATA
Database path (default: data.cdb).
.TP
.B IP, PORT
Listen address and port (defaults: 0.0.0.0 and 53).
.TP
.B DNSCACHEIP
Comma-separated recursive resolver addresses used to refresh ANAME targets.
If unset, nameservers are read from
.IR /etc/resolv.conf .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tinydns-data (1),
.BR tinydns-get (1),
.BR tinydns-conf (1)
